  "details": "When registering an OSC JSON service with the VRChat game client, the VRChat client reads my HOST_INFO endpoint. It then will begin sending OSC traffic to the correct OSC port specified in the HOST_INFO endpoint. However the OSC IP specified in the HOST_INFO endpoint is ignored and traffic is always sent to my LAN interface instead of my specified OSC IP.",
